      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} This was the other day. Earlier in the day, everything was fine. I host an event for the group, and both the bans had the issue. And that's when another admin reported the issue to the council, and I made the shutdown suggestion.\n\nI heard shortly before all this, that some update went out, but that may have been the Beta Branch, I'm on Stable.\n\nI plan on hosting again tonight, a different game, and later, a chill world. So if I have any issues then, I'll be sure to pass it on.\n\nI've gotten an update passed on by the owner of this group, that it MAY be fixed.",
